==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|spedi}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|spēdiġ||having good speed, lucky, prosperous; having means, wealthy, opulent, rich in material wealth; rich in, abounding in, abundant, plenteous, copious; powerful}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*spōdigaz||successful, hurried}}, equivalent to {{suffix|speed|y|lang=en}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|spedie||speedy}}, {{cog|nl|spoedig||speedy, swift, rapid, quick}}, {{cog|de|sputig}}, {{m|de|spudig||industrious, speedy}}.

